data: {"type":"streamAssistantItem","item":"event","value":{"event":"end","part":0,"content":{"type":"text","text":"The Lantern Guild maintains Vesper’s lighthouse. Its lenses run on blue salt mined on Orin; the Guild buys it from Orin’s miners but does **not** own the mines. The *Nightjar* carries salt from April through September, and the Guild uses stored supplies when the strait freezes in winter."}}}

